        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "……そろそろ帰る時間だな。\nうん、確かにいつもより捗ったな。\n実感がある。",
            "enText": "……I reckon it's about time to head back. \nYeah, I can really feel it, I've made much \nmore progress compared to usual.",
