            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "にしても……\n飽きたらやめればいい、か。\nははっ、色々と考えたんだろうな。",
            "enText": "Though… \"You can quit once you're bored \nof it\", you say. <i>Hahah,</i> I bet you have \nthought quite hard about this one.",
