        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "よう、ふたりとも。\n一応、トレーニングってやつだ。\nトレーナーが用意してくれてな。",
            "enText": "Yo you guys. This is more or less just \ntraining though. Trainer prepped the \ncourse for me.",
