        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "場所を変えれば、気分も変わるってさ。\nおかげで、いい具合に捗った。\nもう帰るところだが――",
            "enText": "If you change your environment, then your \nmood goes along with it. Thanks to that, I \nthink I've made some good progress. I was \njust about to head back but ——",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "animData": [
