            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "せっかくだ、あんたたちも試してみるか？\nとっておきのトレーニング。",
            "enText": "Since you guys are here, do you wanna \ngive my special training course a go?",
