        {
            "jpName": "ヒシミラクル",
            "enName": "Hishi Miracle",
            "jpText": "いやいや！\nわたしたちも帰るところなのでっ。\n近道があったら、教えてほしいくらいで……。",
            "enText": "Oh no no! We were also just on our way \nback. It was just that we wanted to ask \nif you knew of any shortcuts around here…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 102,
            "voiceIdx": 50,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 113,
