        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "お？　だったら、ちょうどいい。\n向こうのロープが見えるか？\n何度か往復しているが、頑丈なロープでな。",
            "enText": "Oh? If that's the case, then this'll be \nperfect. See that rope over there? It's \nsturdy alright, I've done many round \ntrips with it.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 191,
