        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "この崖を登ったところに、\n渓流がある。そこに沿って歩けば、\n通常のコースより早く帰れるんだ。",
            "enText": "Once you climb that rope, you'll see a \nlake up there, and if you run along it, \nyou can get back much faster \ncompared to taking the normal path.",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
