            "jpName": "ナリタトップロード",
            "enName": "Narita Top Road",
            "jpText": "ロ、ロープで崖登りを何度も……！？\nさ、さすがですっ。私たちも、負けては\nいられませんっ。ね、ミラ子ちゃん！",
            "enText": "Y-Y-You've done this rope trip multiple \ntimes…!? You're truly something. We \ncan't be backing down now can we, Mirako!",
